# Language & Terminology

## Prohibited Terms (NEVER use in code, docs, or messages)

"Enhanced", "Advanced", "Comprehensive", "Revolutionary", "Cutting-edge", "Robust", "Sophisticated", "Seamless", "Optimized", "Streamlined", "Enterprise-grade", "Mission-critical", "Innovative", "Groundbreaking", "Game-changing", "Best-in-class"

**Use plain technical language:** "Enhanced AI system" → "AI system". "Robust framework" → "Framework".

Applies to: code comments, function names, variable names, log messages, documentation, error messages.
